WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.452
I had been waiting for my birthday.

2
00:00:03.453 --> 00:00:07.952
I was born in the summer.

3
00:00:07.953 --> 00:00:13.618
Hana: All right! My birthday falls on a Saturday this year!

4
00:00:13.619 --> 00:00:16.797
Bada: Your birthday? When is

5
00:00:16.798 --> 00:00:19.043
it? Hana: On July

6
00:00:19.044 --> 00:00:24.667
13. I am going to have a great birthday party!

7
00:00:24.668 --> 00:00:27.357
Bada: What about my birthday?

8
00:00:27.358 --> 00:00:28.976
When is it? Hana:

9
00:00:28.977 --> 00:00:30.898
It's in the winter. Go

10
00:00:30.899 --> 00:00:34.200
and ask Mom about it. Bada: Mom!

11
00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:35.564
Mom: Yes,

12
00:00:35.565 --> 00:00:37.113
dear. Bada: When

13
00:00:37.114 --> 00:00:39.679
is my birthday? Mom: Your

14
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.052
birthday is on December 29. Bada:

15
00:00:44.053 --> 00:00:45.826
Is that soon? Mom:

16
00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:49.549
No, dear. It is still months away. Bada:

17
00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:52.148
How long is that? Mom:

18
00:00:52.149 --> 00:00:58.527
Hmm. You have to wait about 180 days. Bada:

19
00:00:58.528 --> 00:01:03.862
180 days? Wow! Hana:

20
00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:08.958
Mom, can I invite some friends to my birthday party? Mom:

21
00:01:08.959 --> 00:01:13.359
Sure. Just let me know how many will be coming.

22
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.086
Hana: Thanks, Mom!

23
00:01:16.087 --> 00:01:23.445
July is my favorite month because it is the month in which I was born.

24
00:01:23.446 --> 00:01:26.898
When were you born?

